// # LSP QA Index - Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 8 self-test probe drivers that ship with ooda/lsp/.
//
// Setup: Each probe driver is a hostile test for one LSP method or behavior. If a driver fails, ooda/lsp/ fails to release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. probe_initialize.oo - server lifecycle, capabilities, session state init.
//   2. probe_completion.oo - textDocument/completion returns valid items.
//   3. probe_hover.oo - textDocument/hover renders the canonical symbol with Academy header.
//   4. probe_definition.oo - textDocument/definition resolves URI+line+col.
//   5. probe_diagnostics.oo - E-M gauge readings round-trip through Diagnostic JSON.
//   6. probe_formatting.oo - textDocument/formatting produces non-empty edits.
//   7. probe_codeaction.oo - textDocument/codeAction for the 3 live E-M diagnostics.
//   8. probe_double_run.oo - byte-identical determinism across 2 calls.

import "probe_initialize.oo";
import "probe_completion.oo";
import "probe_hover.oo";
import "probe_definition.oo";
import "probe_diagnostics.oo";
import "probe_formatting.oo";
import "probe_codeaction.oo";
import "probe_double_run.oo";
